{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09158","headline":"送李侍御益赴幽州幕 · 韦应物","name":"送李侍御益赴幽州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十挥篇翰，三十穷典坟。\n辟书五府至，名爲四海闻。\n始从车骑幕，今赴嫖姚军。\n契阔晚相遇，草戚遽离羣。\n悠悠行子远，眇眇川途分。\n登高望燕代，日夕生夏云。\n司徒拥精甲，誓将除国氛。\n儒生幸持斧，可以佐功勳。\n无言羽书急，坐阙相思文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}